        // Wipe 900, cash 9 against the 100 that remain, draw 900 back. The 9 is charged
        // 9 / 100 / 2 = 4.5%: the cap, for everyone, until it decays (half-life twelve hours).
        pumper.pump(900 ether, 9 ether);
